   "versionNonce": 942561,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "How it works: six steps for every destination",
   "originalText": "How it works: six steps for every destination",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a09-text-10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 933,
   "height": 170,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 79190,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Normal path: follow S’s shortest path (lowest id on ties): S → E → D.\n2. Affected? It meets a failed link, so yes. The router just before it is the PLR (point of local\n   repair): S, next hop E.\n3. Repair: the PLR uses the backup it built for that one link. Every other router keeps its normal\n   table. Any router whose own link is down repairs too.\n4. Converge: remove everything that failed, run SPF again: S → N → M → D (21).\n5. Status, first match wins: unreachable, repaired, dropped, looped.\n6. Repair = final? Compare at the PLR: same, same-cost or longer.",
   "originalText": "1. Normal path: follow S’s shortest path (lowest id on ties): S → E → D.\n2. Affected? It meets a failed link, so yes. The router just before it is the PLR (point of local\n   repair): S, next hop E.\n3. Repair: the PLR uses the backup it built for that one link. Every other router keeps its normal\n   table. Any router whose own link is down repairs too.\n4. Converge: remove everything that failed, run SPF again: S → N → M → D (21).\n5. Status, first match wins: unreachable, repaired, dropped, looped.\n6. Repair = final? Compare at the PLR: same, same-cost or longer.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a09-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 346,
   "width": 437,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Step 3 for Example 6, in each repair mode",
   "originalText": "Step 3 for Example 6, in each repair mode",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a09-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 380,
   "width": 720,
   "height": 169,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Mode          What the traffic does                                     Status\n------------  --------------------------------------------------------  --------\nLFA only      S → N: S’s LFA, link-protecting only (2 < 1 + 1 fails).   repaired\n              N’s path is N → E → D: N finds N–E down and uses its own\n              LFA M, node-protecting (10 < 11 + 1).  Cost 21, = final.\nLFA + RLFA    the same: there is an LFA, so Remote LFA doesn’t run.     repaired\nTI-LFA        S pushes [16005], out via N (path S → N → E → D).         looped\n              N finds N–E down; its own TI-LFA path is N → S → E → D,\n              so the packet goes back to S with the same label.",
   "originalText": "Mode          What the traffic does                                     Status\n------------  --------------------------------------------------------  --------\nLFA only      S → N: S’s LFA, link-protecting only (2 < 1 + 1 fails).   repaired\n              N’s path is N → E → D: N finds N–E down and uses its own\n              LFA M, node-protecting (10 < 11 + 1).  Cost 21, = final.\nLFA + RLFA    the same: there is an LFA, so Remote LFA doesn’t run.     repaired\nTI-LFA        S pushes [16005], out via N (path S → N → E → D).         looped\n              N finds N–E down; its own TI-LFA path is N → S → E → D,\n              so the packet goes back to S with the same label.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a09-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 559,
   "width": 959,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "E as a destination is unreachable, as expected: shown on its own line, not as a protection failure. N and M\nare not affected.",
   "originalText": "E as a destination is unreachable, as expected: shown on its own line, not as a protection failure. N and M\nare not affected.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a09-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 609,
   "width": 107,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The lesson",
   "originalText": "The lesson",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
