   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "TI-LFA:   C  S→A→B→C     3  same\n          E  S→A→B→C→E   4  same\nLFA only: C  LFA A, repaired\n          E  no LFA → dropped",
